  "solution": {
    "text": "In isothermal process<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; PV = constant<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>PdV</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>VdP</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>dP</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>dV</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;Bulk modulus, <math> <mrow> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>dP</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>dV</mtext> <mo>/</mo> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>dP</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>dV</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow><mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>P</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>P</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><strong>Note:</strong> Adiabatic bulk modulus is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>γP</mi></math>",
